{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32206","headline":"赠蜀府将 · 温庭筠","name":"赠蜀府将","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"十年分散劒关秋，万事皆随锦水流。\n志气已曾明汉节，功名犹自滞吴钩。\n鵰边认箭寒云重，马上听笳塞草愁。\n今日逢君倍惆怅，灌婴韩信尽封侯。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"温庭筠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32206.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32206","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}